{
    "title": "Funk Studio - Make Your Mods",
    "description": "Introducing the ultimate rhythm experience - Make, share & play funky mods! World's 1st mobile mod engine & mod online platform.\r\n\r\nEasily create and customize mods & rhythm games without any coding knowledge required. \r\n\r\nChoose from a range of pre-made assets or create your own using the Mod Editor: an intuitive, simple-yet-powerful creation interface that lets you put together a project in just matter of seconds, that makes creating and sharing mods a breeze!\r\n\r\nMake your mods / rhythm games as simple or complex as you like, with a full arsenal of powerful features at your disposal: Chart editor, song maker, map editor, custom cutscenes, gameplay dialogs, Auto sprite rescaling, hundreds of premade assets to choose from, and much more!\r\n\r\nOnce you've created your masterpiece, share it with the world! Our online sharing platform lets you upload your mods with the community, where they can be enjoyed by other players from around the globe. Discover and play mods created by other users, and show off your own creations!\r\n\r\nFunk Studio is designed to be user-friendly and accessible to everyone, opening the doors of modding to even the most casual players. Whether you're a seasoned modder or a newcomer to the scene, you'll find everything you need to create and share amazing mods with our app.\r\n\r\nSo why wait? Get Funk Studio today and enter a new era of rhythm gaming!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Introducing the ultimate rhythm experience - Make, share &amp; play funky mods! World&#39;s 1st mobile mod engine &amp; mod online platform.<br><br>Easily create and customize mods &amp; rhythm games without any coding knowledge required. <br><br>Choose from a range of pre-made assets or create your own using the Mod Editor: an intuitive, simple-yet-powerful creation interface that lets you put together a project in just matter of seconds, that makes creating and sharing mods a breeze!<br><br>Make your mods / rhythm games as simple or complex as you like, with a full arsenal of powerful features at your disposal: Chart editor, song maker, map editor, custom cutscenes, gameplay dialogs, Auto sprite rescaling, hundreds of premade assets to choose from, and much more!<br><br>Once you&#39;ve created your masterpiece, share it with the world! Our online sharing platform lets you upload your mods with the community, where they can be enjoyed by other players from around the globe. Discover and play mods created by other users, and show off your own creations!<br><br>Funk Studio is designed to be user-friendly and accessible to everyone, opening the doors of modding to even the most casual players. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned modder or a newcomer to the scene, you&#39;ll find everything you need to create and share amazing mods with our app.<br><br>So why wait? Get Funk Studio today and enter a new era of rhythm gaming!",
    "summary": "Make, share & play funky mods! Codeless engine and online platform.",
